  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "I.S.A.K.Nazar vs State: Rep By on 26 November, 2021 Author: N. Sathish Kumar Bench: N.Sathish Kumar Crl.O.P.No In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 26.11.2021 Coram: The Honourable Mr.Justice N.Sathish Kumar Crl.O.P.No.19747 of 2017 and Crl.M.P.Nos. 11916 & 11917 of 2017 I.S.A.K.Nazar ..Petitioner Vs. State: rep by N.Karmegam, The Food Safety Officer, Ambattur-II, Code No.524, Office of the Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Medicine Administration Department, Asoori Street,Thiruvallur. ...Respondent Prayer: Criminal Original Petition filed under Section 482 of the C Criminal Procedure (Cr.P.C) call for the records and to quash all p as against the petitioner in C.C.No.131 of 2017 on the file of the Magistrate, Ambattur, Chennai. 1/6 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis Crl. Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/106154971/ 1 For petitioner : Mr.S.Prabakaran Senior Counsel for Mr.M.A.Gouthaman For respondent : Mr.S.Vinothkumar Government Advocate (crl. ***** Order",
    "facts": "2. It is the case of the prosecution that one Manna Health Mix, Southern Health Foods Pvt Ltd., is the manufacturer of the alleged Health Drink and the same was sent for analysis and report was received on 10.06.2014, indicating that the sample deviates from the declared value of protein. Hence the sample was sub-standard, unsafe and misbranded, as per Section 3 (1) (zx), 3 (1) (zz) (v) (x) and 3 (1) (zf) (A-i) of FSS Act, 2006. Subsequent, sample sent is also contained the same. Moreover, sanction for prosecution was given only on 12/4/2017, without even ascertaining the particulars of the accused. Hence prays for quashing C.C.No.131 of 2017, pending on the file of the Judicial Magistrate, Ambattur. 5.",
    "arguments": "4. The learned counsel appearing for the petitioner submitted that the complaint was filed on 12/5/2017 for the alleged commission of offence on 29/5/2014. As per Section 77 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, the Commissioner of Food Safety, has to record the reasons in writing and accord prosecution within an extended period of upto three years. The learned Government Advocate (crl.side) appearing for the respondent produced a letter dated 12/4/2017 of the Commissioner of Food Safety and Drug Administration, Chennai, wherein it is stated that sanction https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis accorded to launch prosecution to the respondent herein for the food sample of Manna Health Mix, which was lifted from Annai Store, Chennai./A.1. 6.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "4. The learned counsel appearing for the petitioner submitted that the complaint was filed on 12/5/2017 for the alleged commission of offence on 29/5/2014. As per Section 77 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, the Commissioner of Food Safety, has to record the reasons in writing and accord prosecution within an extended period of upto three years. The learned Government Advocate (crl.side) appearing for the respondent produced a letter dated 12/4/2017 of the Commissioner of Food Safety and Drug Administration, Chennai, wherein it is stated that sanction https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis accorded to launch prosecution to the respondent herein for the food sample of Manna Health Mix, which was lifted from Annai Store, Chennai./A.1. 6.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
